      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_16866758879b91128cddec3351ab359324f02559184f9f3c4fcdc2a85c68964d"
      ],
      "text": "Worktree management uses a hybrid Git engine: go-git for fast in-process reads (status, diff, line stats) and system Git preferred for commits and mutations to preserve hooks, signing, filters, and user config; read and write engines are independently selectable in Settings."
    },
    {
