          "repository": "fy0/codekanban",
          "url": "https://github.com/fy0/CodeKanban/blob/921b2512aeb00ca37b27a8f711ca6479c0d8b9e0/README.md#L135-L137"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_538df5497f15d304a99f7690507b86a340072a731928a149d802bcabb0b7cafe"
      ],
      "text": "The build produces a single-file executable: frontend artifacts from ui/dist are copied to static/ and embedded into the Go binary."
    },
