        "slc_fa7cb39144ab1ec2d6b73bfcbbb46a8adb0e347ca5485b5c4cc449d8dd1687b1"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: AGENTS.md instructs contributors to run `go test ./...` (optionally with -race), regenerate SQLC before committing schema changes, and run `go vet ./...` during review."
    },
