          "url": "https://github.com/fy0/CodeKanban/blob/921b2512aeb00ca37b27a8f711ca6479c0d8b9e0/AGENTS.md#L14-L14"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8fe8d225e493efd4d963da41770f055262b4fa79e2a4bdd6bcad9daf1b5a6516"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors must format with gofmt, group imports with goimports, use PascalCase/camelCase naming, and write structured zap log fields instead of printf-style strings."
    },
